msgstr "Use [Inworld Realtime STT](https://docs.inworld.ai/stt/overview) for live transcription. Paste the Base64 API credentials from Inworld Portal as-is; do not encode them again."

#: src/settings/ai/stt/configure.tsx
msgid "Use [Mistral](https://mistral.ai) for transcriptions. Keep the Base URL as `https://api.mistral.ai/v1` (Reset under Advanced if you pasted a transcriptions endpoint). **Voxtral Mini Transcribe 2** transcribes after recording; the realtime model is for live captions."
msgstr "Use [Mistral](https://mistral.ai) for transcriptions. Keep the Base URL as `https://api.mistral.ai/v1` (Reset under Advanced if you pasted a transcriptions endpoint). **Voxtral Mini Transcribe 2** transcribes after recording; the realtime model is for live captions."

