msgid "Use [Modulate](https://docs.modulate.ai/get-started/stt) for live transcription. The multilingual model supports 25 European languages; the English model supports English only. Speaker labels identify up to four speakers with the multilingual model."
msgstr "Use [Modulate](https://docs.modulate.ai/get-started/stt) for live transcription. The multilingual model supports 25 European languages; the English model supports English only. Speaker labels identify up to four speakers with the multilingual model."

